abstract: "A local-first desktop interface for locally managed language models and repository-grounded exploration of scientific dynamical-model repositories. Ask the Model v0.7.0 adds the source-qualified Energy Institute TES chart alongside GISTEMP and strengthens managed conversation-export reconciliation and native series-contract validation. It preserves source provenance through History and retains the established grounded-turn durability and fail-closed persistence boundaries."
keywords:
